meta {
  name: Simplespace Get Space
  type: http
  seq: 151
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/xrpc/com.atproto.simplespace.getSpace?space=at://{{did}}/space/org.example.bucket/main
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

params:query {
  space: at://{{did}}/space/org.example.bucket/main
}

docs {
  Describe a simplespace space: { uri, readPolicy, writePolicy, appAccess } with the policies and appAccess
  rendered as their lexicon unions ($type). Served by the space host.

  Two credentials reach it: an OAuth/session caller with a "space:…?action=read_self"
  grant who IS the space's authority (400 NotSpaceOwner otherwise), or a space credential
  for the space (Authorization: Atproto-Space <credential>, Atproto-Space-Audience: the
  authority's DID, and an RFC 9421 atproto-space signature over both by the credential's
  cnf.kid) — what a member hosted anywhere presents. Bearer or DPoP presentation of a
  credential is refused.

  Errors: 400 SpaceNotFound (absent, deleted, or a space whose authority lives elsewhere).
}
